{# A full-width band between the homepage's own sections. Content is the
   fare-alert list -- a real feature, already built (the footer's own
   `subscribers` form, `/ajax/subscribe`), promoted here rather than
   invented for the slot: this is the demo's own placeholder for "whatever
   goes here next," and a real signup is more honest than mock copy for
   something that doesn't exist.

   A second `.js-subscribe` form, not a link down to the footer's -- see
   `global.js`, which used to assume there was only ever one and now wires
   up every one it finds.

   The background (`public/img/banner-sky.jpg`) is a real photo the owner
   supplied -- a dusk sky gradient with a plane climbing in the lower
   right, mostly empty sky on the left where the copy sits. Re-encoded
   from the original PNG to a quality-82 JPEG (1.1MB -> 90KB) with `sips`;
   nothing else about it was edited. `text-white text-shadow-1` is the
   same pairing `index/poi.html.twig` already proves legible over any
   photo card, bright or dark.

   The submit button keeps `--brand-accent-fill`: that token's own
   docblock in main.css reserves the accent for the one action a screen is
   allowed, but a visitor has scrolled the hero's "Search flights" out of
   view by the time they reach this band, the same reasoning
   `.footer__subscribe-submit`/`.route-watch__submit` already rely on. #}
<div class="homepage-banner" style="background-image: url('{{ asset('/img/banner-sky.jpg') }}');">
    <div class="container homepage-banner__inner">
        <div class="homepage-banner__copy text-white text-shadow-1">
            <h2 class="homepage-banner__title" id="homepage-fare-alerts-title">Never miss a price drop</h2>
            <p class="homepage-banner__text">
                Leave your address and it goes on the fare-alert list. Nothing is sent yet
                &mdash; there is no mail behind this demonstration.
            </p>
        </div>

        {% set notice = subscribe_notice() %}
        <form class="homepage-banner__form js-subscribe" id="homepage-fare-alerts"
              action="/ajax/subscribe" method="post" novalidate
              aria-labelledby="homepage-fare-alerts-title">
            <input type="hidden" name="{{ csrf_field() }}" value="{{ csrf_token() }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="{{ current_page() }}">

            <div class="homepage-banner__row">
                <label class="visually-hidden" for="homepage-fare-alerts-email">Email address</label>
                <input class="homepage-banner__input js-subscribe-email"
                       id="homepage-fare-alerts-email" type="email" name="email" required
                       autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
                <button class="homepage-banner__submit" type="submit">Join the list</button>
            </div>

            <p class="homepage-banner__note js-subscribe-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"
               {% if notice %}data-tone="{{ notice.tone }}"{% endif %}>{{ notice ? notice.message : '' }}</p>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
